   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to support the Recipient&apos;s rural communes in planning and implementing local development activities in a participatory and sustainable manner. The Project contributes to the second phase of the National Program for Decentralized Rural Development.</narrative>
  </description>
